  "summary": "Malicious code in trajmetrics (PyPI)",
  "details": "When starting as a module, the package scans the whole system and exfiltrates selected files by type. If following the README instruction, it starts a background job constantly monitoring the system and exfiltrating files as soon as they change.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-10-trajmetrics\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - native-extension\n\n\n - files-exfiltration\n\n",
